+/*
+ * SPI offload wiring schema
+ *
+ *     +-------------+         +-------------+
+ *     |         CNV |<-----+--| GPIO        |
+ *     |             |      +--| PWM0        |
+ *     |             |         |             |
+ *     |             |      +--| PWM1        |
+ *     |             |      |  +-------------+
