+ *     |             |         |             |
+ *     |     ADC     |         |    SPI      |
+ *     |             |         | controller  |
+ *     |             |         |             |
+ *     |         SDI |<--------| SDO         |
+ *     |         SDO |-------->| SDI         |
+ *     |        SCLK |<--------| SCLK        |
+ *     +-------------+         +-------------+
